Output docs/recordings/source-layer-contract-viewer.gif

Require python3

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1000
Set Height 700
Set Padding 14
Set Framerate 10
Set TypingSpeed 1ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "./run-viewer.sh --source-key player-1100-L3 --compact" Enter
Wait+Screen /SOURCE LAYER CONTRACT VIEWER/
Show
Sleep 2s

Type "]"
Sleep 2s
Type "v"
Sleep 2s
Type "v"
Sleep 1s
Type "["
Sleep 2s
Type "."
Sleep 2s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
